        "description": "The DC Compass is a chat interface that lets you ask and receive answers related to datasets on Open Data DC. DC Compass provides you with quick and convenient access to information about DC without having to search through multiple datasets related to your question. This chat interface can answer a range of questions related to statistics, summaries, and other location specific information. In addition, DC Compass can create maps and other visualizations with the associated answers and provide suggestions for additional datasets and initiatives related to your questions.\n\n<div><br /></div>\n\n<div>DO NOT DELETE OR MODIFY THIS ITEM. This item is managed by the ArcGIS Hub application. To make changes to this page, please visit https://DCGIS.hub.arcgis.com:/overview/edit.</div>",
